          "text": "To the chief Musician upon Mahalath, Maschil, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "A Psalm",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of David. The fool hath said in his heart, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "There is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no God. They are corrupt, and have done abominable iniquity: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none that doeth good.",
          "kind": "text"
