      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.53.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God looked down from heaven upon the children of men, to see if there were ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that did understand, that did seek God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.53.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.53.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every one of them is gone back: they are altogether become filthy; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none that doeth good, no, not one.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.53.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.53.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Have the workers of iniquity no knowledge? who eat up my people ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they eat bread! they have not called upon God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.53.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.53.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There they were in great fear, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "where",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no fear was: for God hath scattered the bones of him that encampeth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "against",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thee: thou hast put ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to shame, because God hath despised them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.53.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.53.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O that the salvation of Israel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were come",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " out of Zion! when God bringeth back the captivity of his people, Jacob shall rejoice, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Israel shall be glad.",
          "kind": "text"
